From 61745243cd1c105814fc57aaa144e661084f4a44 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chiro <chiro2001@163.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 00:17:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 113/256] feat(pypto-x): add W8A8 scheme descriptor and scalar
 reference goldens

Contract 0002 C1 (qwen35-w8a8-scheme):
- QuantizedTensorDesc in pypto.core_ir (fields per section 3.3);
  per_group and BF16 scale fail closed; to_dict/from_dict round trip.
- Scalar reference goldens for the four public opcodes:
  quantize_per_token_s8, dequantize_s8, qmatmul_s8s8_s32,
  dequantize_epilogue_bf16.
- Q1-Q6 boundaries: all-zero row s=1.0/q=0, NaN/Inf rejection,
  saturation count field, RNE ties-to-even shared with BF16 RNE,
  K<=133144 limit, non-2D reshape to [rows, K].
- R1-R5 focused tests in python/tests/ut/pypto_x/test_w8a8_scheme.py.

No backend kernels, lowering or runtime changes.
